      "status": "unknown",
      "commandLine": "*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: .tura/script/start-preview.cmd\n+@echo off\n+set PORT=43128\n+set HOST=127.0.0.1\n+npm run start\n*** Update File: .tura/script/preview-smoke.ps1\n@@\n-$environment = @{ PORT = '43128'; HOST = '127.0.0.1' }\n-$process = Start-Process -FilePath 'npm.cmd' -ArgumentList @('run','start') -WorkingDirectory $root -RedirectStandardOutput $stdout -RedirectStandardError $stderr -PassThru -Environment $environment\n+$wrapper = Join-Path $PSScriptRoot 'start-preview.cmd'\n+$process = Start-Process -FilePath $wrapper -WorkingDirectory $root -RedirectStandardOutput $stdout -RedirectStandardError $stderr -PassThru\n*** End Patch",
